NOTICE — third-party data
=========================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the source code of this library.

It does not cover the emission factor and global warming potential values shipped
under data/. Those are reproduced from third-party publications and remain subject
to the terms of their original publishers. Each catalog set records its own source,
publication year and licence in its "source" block, and those records are compiled
into the library so that a consumer can read them at run time.

No dataset is added to this repository without a redistribution licence that permits
it. Sets currently shipped:

  data/gwp/ar5.json
  data/gwp/ar6.json
      IPCC Fifth and Sixth Assessment Report GWP-100 values.
      Factual constants reproduced with attribution; the IPCC permits reproduction
      of figures and tables from the assessment reports with citation.

  data/factors/defra-2026-secr.json
      UK Government greenhouse gas conversion factors 2026, published by the
      Department for Energy Security and Net Zero.
      Open Government Licence v3.0. Contains public sector information licensed
      under the Open Government Licence v3.0:
      https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

  data/examples/*.json
      Synthetic values authored for this repository purely so the build and the
      tests have something to work against. Not derived from any published dataset,
      never valid for reporting, and excluded from released packages.
